<div class="admissions-popup-overlay" id="admissionsPopup">
  <div class="admissions-popup-box">
    <button type="button" class="admissions-popup-close" id="admissionsPopupClose" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    <a href="/admissions">
      <img src="/images/admissions-popup.jpg" alt="Admissions Open at The WABE International School, Mianwali" />
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="hero hero-video" style="background-image:url('/images/campus/classroom-1.jpg');">
  <div class="hero-content hero-panel-box">
    <span class="eyebrow">Nursery &mdash; Class 10 &bull; Federal Board</span>
    <h1>Do School Differently</h1>
    <p class="lede"><%= school.tagline %>. The WABE International School, Mianwali Campus blends academic rigor with digital learning, scientific inquiry, and confident communication &mdash; so every student is ready for what's next.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/admissions" class="btn btn-secondary">Apply for Admission</a>
      <a href="/academics" class="btn btn-outline-light">Explore Academics</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our Six Pillars</span>
      <h2>What Every WABE Student Builds</h2>
      <p>Rooted in our crest, these six pillars shape every lesson, club, and assessment at WABE Mianwali.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon pillar-icon pillar-1"><%- icon('graduationCap') %></div>
        <h3>Academic Excellence</h3>
        <p>Rigorous, Federal Board-aligned instruction with continuous assessment and remedial support.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon pillar-icon pillar-2"><%- icon('laptop') %></div>
        <h3>Digital Learning</h3>
        <p>Computer science and digital literacy woven into the curriculum from an early age.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon pillar-icon pillar-3"><%- icon('microscope') %></div>
        <h3>Scientific Inquiry</h3>
        <p>Hands-on lab work and experiments that turn curiosity into a habit of investigation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon pillar-icon pillar-4"><%- icon('mic') %></div>
        <h3>Confident Communication</h3>
        <p>Debate, presentation, and language skills built through daily classroom practice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon pillar-icon pillar-5"><%- icon('bulb') %></div>
        <h3>Curiosity & Innovation</h3>
        <p>Project-based learning that rewards asking "why" and "what if."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon pillar-icon pillar-6"><%- icon('globe') %></div>
        <h3>Global Citizenship</h3>
        <p>An awareness of community, culture, and the wider world beyond Mianwali.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container grid grid-2" style="align-items:center; gap:48px;">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our Campus</span>
      <h2>A Calm, Purpose-Built Learning Environment</h2>
      <p>The WABE International School, Mianwali Campus was built around the idea that a school should feel considered &mdash; light-filled classrooms, dedicated science labs, a digital learning lab, and space to play, all under one roof.</p>
      <ul class="pillars-icon-list">
        <li><%- icon('check') %> Purpose-built classrooms for Nursery through Class 10</li>
        <li><%- icon('check') %> Dedicated science and computer labs</li>
        <li><%- icon('check') %> A library and reading corner for every age group</li>
        <li><%- icon('check') %> On-campus guidance and counseling support</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline">More About Us</a>
    </div>
    <div class="campus-photo reveal">
      <img src="/images/campus/classroom-2.jpg" alt="Students in a classroom discussion at The WABE International School" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tinted">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">A Message to Parents</span>
      <h2>From Our Coordinator</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card testimonial reveal ceo-message coordinator-message">
      <img src="/images/coordinator-arif-khan.jpg" alt="Dr. Muhammad Arif Khan, Coordinator" class="coordinator-photo" />
      <p>Every child who walks through our doors deserves to be seen, understood, and challenged to grow &mdash; that is the promise WABE keeps, every single day.</p>
      <div class="who">
        Dr. Muhammad Arif Khan<br />
        <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.85rem;">Coordinator, WABE International School</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Testimonials</span>
      <h2>What Our Community Says</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card testimonial reveal testimonial-blue">
        <p>"Our son has become so much more confident speaking in front of others since joining WABE. He asks questions now instead of staying quiet."</p>
        <div class="who">&mdash; Muhammad Kashif, Parent</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card testimonial reveal testimonial-green">
        <p>"The school's use of technology stands out &mdash; the digital classes and science labs make learning feel hands-on instead of just memorizing from a book."</p>
        <div class="who">&mdash; Imran Ahmed, Parent</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card testimonial reveal testimonial-gold">
        <p>"The teachers genuinely know each child. My daughter looks forward to school every single day because of how much the faculty cares."</p>
        <div class="who">&mdash; Saad Khan, Parent</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <div>
        <h2>Admissions Are Open</h2>
        <p>Book a campus visit or start your online application today.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-band-actions">
        <a href="/admissions" class="btn" style="background:var(--white); color:var(--green-700);">Apply Now</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline-light">Book a Visit</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
